---
// Module 1: Spectral Foundations. Same five-block rhythm as Module 0.
// Behold the overtones, derive the triad from partials 4-5-6, operate an
// additive-synthesis sandbox, answer two multiple-choice prompts, bridge
// into Module 2.
import Module1Behold from './Module1Behold';
import Module1Derive from './Module1Derive';
import Module1Operate from './Module1Operate';
import Module1Prompts from './Module1Prompts';
---

<div class="m1">
  <section class="m1-block">
    <p class="m1-eyebrow">behold</p>
    <p>
      Play any low note and listen close. You hear a single pitch — but
      the string itself is vibrating at every integer multiple of its
      fundamental at once. Those overtones are the rest of the chord
      already inside the note. Here are the first eight partials of low
      C; tap any row to hear it alone.
    </p>
    <Module1Behold client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m1-block">
    <p class="m1-eyebrow">derive</p>
    <p>
      The first few partials above the fundamental hand you the
      ingredients of the triad: octave (×2), perfect fifth (×3), next
      octave (×4), major third (×5), next fifth (×6). Stack partials
      <strong>4, 5, 6</strong> together — that's a <em>major triad</em>,
      regardless of which fundamental you picked. The chord is a fact of
      the spectrum, not a theory we imposed.
    </p>
    <Module1Derive client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m1-block">
    <p class="m1-eyebrow">operate</p>
    <p>
      Now build a tone partial by partial. Toggle the harmonics on and
      off and listen to the timbre change. The pitch stays the same —
      the ear's name for it doesn't move — but the <em>color</em> shifts
      as partials enter and leave the recipe. Timbre is harmonic
      content.
    </p>
    <Module1Operate client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m1-block">
    <p class="m1-eyebrow">prompt</p>
    <p class="m1-prompt-intro">
      Two cards on the spectrum. Same "unsure" rule applies — honesty
      brings the card back around sooner.
    </p>
    <Module1Prompts client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m1-block m1-bridge">
    <p class="m1-eyebrow">bridge</p>
    <p>
      The fifth came in second, the third came in fifth. Two intervals,
      already. Next: why do <em>fifths</em>, specifically, link into a
      cycle that visits every pitch class once? The answer is one short
      identity in Z<sub>12</sub>.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>

<style is:global>
  /* Module 1 chrome. Mirrors Module 0's structure; rules live alongside
     Module 0's so both share the page's typography without either
     reaching into the other. */
  .m1 {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }
  .m1-block {
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .m1-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
  }
  .m1 p {
    font-family: var(--font-crimson);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .m1 p em {
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .m1 p strong {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m1-bridge p {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent-dim);
    padding-left: 1rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .m1-prompt-intro {
    font-size: 0.95rem !important;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
  }

  /* Behold ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m1-behold {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0.55rem;
    max-width: 420px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .m1-partial {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr 3rem;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.7rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    transition:
      background 0.2s ease,
      border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .m1-partial:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
  }
  .m1-partial.triad {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
    background: rgba(232, 168, 56, 0.06);
  }
  .m1-partial.active {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: rgba(232, 168, 56, 0.18);
  }
  .m1-partial-n {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m1-partial-note {
    font-family: var(--font-crimson);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .m1-partial-note sup {
    font-size: 0.6em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-left: 0.1em;
  }
  .m1-partial.triad .m1-partial-note {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m1-partial-ratio {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    text-align: right;
  }
  .m1-behold-foot {
    font-size: 0.82rem !important;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0.7rem 0 0 !important;
    line-height: 1.45 !important;
  }
  .m1-behold-foot strong {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .m1-behold-foot sup {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* Derive ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m1-derive {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .m1-fund-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .m1-fund-label {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m1-fund-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .m1-fund-btn {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background 0.15s ease,
      color 0.15s ease,
      border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m1-fund-btn.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m1-fund-btn:hover:not(.active) {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m1-derive-caption {
    text-align: center;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin: 0 !important;
    font-size: 0.95rem !important;
    max-width: 38ch;
  }
  .m1-derive-caption strong {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .m1-derive-play {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.45rem 1.1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background 0.15s ease,
      color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m1-derive-play:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background: var(--accent-dim);
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
  }
  .m1-derive-play:disabled {
    cursor: default;
    background: var(--bg-button);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    border-color: var(--border);
  }

  /* Operate --------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m1-operate {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .m1-toggle-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .m1-toggle {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    width: 3rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background 0.15s ease,
      border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m1-toggle:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
  }
  .m1-toggle-n {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m1-toggle-dot {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .m1-toggle.on .m1-toggle-dot {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m1-toggle.triad {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
  }
  .m1-toggle.triad.on {
    background: rgba(232, 168, 56, 0.1);
  }
  .m1-operate-controls {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .m1-operate-play {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background 0.15s ease,
      color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m1-operate-play:hover {
    background: var(--accent-dim);
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
  }
  .m1-operate-play.on {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m1-operate-play.on:hover {
    background: var(--bg-button);
  }
  .m1-operate-caption {
    font-size: 0.9rem !important;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 40ch;
    line-height: 1.5 !important;
  }

  /* Prompts list — uses the same .prompt chrome as Module 0. */
  .m1-prompts {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Multiple-choice instrument ------------------------------------------- */
  .multiple-choice-instrument {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }
  .mc-choices {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .mc-choice {
    font-family: var(--font-crimson);
    font-size: 1rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    transition:
      border-color 0.15s ease,
      background 0.15s ease,
      color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .mc-choice:hover:not(:disabled) {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .mc-choice.selected {
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .mc-choice.correct {
    background: rgba(232, 168, 56, 0.12);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .mc-choice.wrong {
    background: rgba(186, 70, 70, 0.08);
    border-color: rgba(186, 70, 70, 0.5);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .mc-choice:disabled {
    cursor: default;
  }
</style>
